  "body": "Coastal Convenience Meets Ultimate Versatility\r\n\r\nAsking Price: $875,000\r\n\r\nPositioned perfectly in the heart of Orewa, this exceptional three-level townhouse in the secure, gated Boulevard townhouse complex offers the ultimate blend of beachside living, lock-and-leave convenience, and a highly versatile layout. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor layout features a bedroom with its own ensuite and independent entry, offering complete separation from the rest of the home. This configuration is ideal for families wanting space, a work-from-home office, a private teenager's retreat, or a lucrative guest accommodation setup.\r\nGarage/laundry with internal access via the gated security entrance is also located on this ground floor.\r\n\r\nThe middle floor serves as the central hub of the home, featuring an open-plan kitchen, dining, and main living zone that flows out onto private balconies front and back—perfect for relaxing after a day at the beach or hosting friends.\r\n\r\nThe top floor rounds out the accommodation with two additional bright double bedrooms and a well-appointed central bathroom.\r\n\r\nBoth upper floor decks have views of Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nLeave the car in your secure lock-up garage—everything you need is right on your doorstep. You are uniquely situated on the flat, just moments from the pristine sands of Orewa Beach and the vibrant local surf club/cafe. A short, flat stroll takes you directly to the local Woolworths supermarket and the bustling township filled with top-tier cafes and restaurants.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a beachside permanent residence, a smart investment, or a versatile home with independent spaces, Unit 28 delivers it all in spotless, near-new condition.\r\n\r\nThanks to a recent partial redecoration, the home offers a beautiful, turn-key aesthetic that lets you move straight in without lifting a finger.\r\n\r\nA pool is provided for the use of owners and their guests.\r\n\r\nPlease note, some of the photos have been virtual staged with AI and the generic floor plan provided is not an exact representation.\r\n\r\nFor all enquiries please call\r\nLes M 021467228",
